	(text "ROUTING - USB FS\nUSB_DP/USB_DM: 90R differential pair, length-matched within 1mm,\nover solid GND, no vias if possible, no stubs.\nJoin J2 A6/B6 and A7/B7 at the connector. U5 right at J2, then to PA11/PA12.\nR8/R9 near J2. SWD to J3 short."
		(at 110.49 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
				(color 255 0 0 1)
			)
