  (text "R39/R40 22R: series resistors on SWCLK/SWDIO.\nDamp ringing on the probe cable. They do not protect against a mis-plugged\n5V probe (~50mA). Not critical (0R works). J3 must be keyed.\nU5 pin 5 on +3V3 (not VBUS): stops D+ back-feeding VBUS when unplugged."
    (at 199.39 156.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b29fa268-4b0f-42ec-b222-88b464e964c6")
  )
