		(property "Description" "USBLC6-2SC6 ESD on D+/D- (pins 1<->6 D+, 3<->4 D-), 3.5pF max. Pin 5 (rail) on +3V3, not VBUS: on VBUS, the D+ 1.5k pull-up back-feeds VBUS to ~2.8V through the internal diode when the cable is unplugged and detach cannot be seen. FS D+/D- never exceed 3.6V, so a 3V3 rail reference is sufficient."
			(at 152.4 119.38 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
