		(property "Description" "Bourns MF-MSMF075-2 PTC, 1812, on USB VBUS. Ihold 0.75A / Itrip 1.50A at 23C, 0.60A hold at 50C, R 0.11-0.45 Ohm (Bourns derating table). U13 limits USB current to 0.455-0.560A first; F1 is backup for a U13 or cable short. MF-MSMF050 was replaced because its 0.40A hold at 50C tripped below U13's limit."
